      "hints": [
        "The two parallel branches have the 1.8 V potential difference found in part (b)(i). Find the current in the known 4.5 Ω branch first.",
        "Subtract that branch current from the 1.6 A battery current, then use the shared potential difference to find wire X's resistance."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
